  "description": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "Universidad CEU Cardenal Herrera (UCH-CEU) is a private Catholic university in Valencia, Spain, part of the CEU Universities network, known for its excellence in medicine, veterinary science, architecture, and health sciences.",
      "UCH-CEU's Faculty of Medicine and Faculty of Veterinary Science are among the most respected in Spain, attracting ambitious students from across Spain and internationally who aspire to health professions careers.",
      "The university provides a deeply integrated educational model where faith, science, and professional excellence are intertwined, producing graduates known for both technical competence and personal integrity.",
      "Valencia — Spain's third largest city and a rising European innovation hub — offers an exceptional Mediterranean lifestyle, affordable costs of living, and growing opportunities in technology, design, and health industries."
    ],
    "paragraphsRu": [
      "Universidad CEU Cardenal Herrera (UCH-CEU) — частный католический университет в Валенсии, Испания, входящий в сеть CEU Universities, известный превосходством в области медицины, ветеринарии, архитектуры и медицинских наук.",
      "Медицинский факультет и факультет ветеринарии UCH-CEU являются одними из самых уважаемых в Испании, привлекая амбициозных студентов из Испании и международного сообщества.",
